# Owner authorized DAT/decoded images/private dumps/SD images on 2026-11-10, reaffirmed 2026-11-11.
# Binary/local ignore patterns above are staging safeguards, not a data prohibition.
# Add other manifest-approved data by exact path with git add -f; see firmware-data/README.md.
!/firmware-data/gfx100s/2.13/GXUP0004.DAT
!/firmware-data/gfx100s/2.13/decoded/boot.bin
!/firmware-data/gfx100s/2.13/decoded/kernel.bin
!/firmware-data/gfx100s/2.13/decoded/section4.bin
!/firmware-data/gfx100s/2.13/decoded/section5.bin
!/tools/release/discovery/slot0-phy.seed.bin
!/tools/release/discovery/slot1-phy.seed.bin

# Closed-run host image lease artifacts are not experiment data.
*.img.lock

# Closed diagnostic traces are archived once as .json.gz; restore only under local/.
# Existing tracked originals remain until their consumers have been audited.
evidence/**/diagnostics/discovery-*.json
